{"file_id":"LANG_MYOUTER_STAFF_COMMENT.OLANG","resource_class":"STAGEDAT_OLANG","part":6,"range":"250-299","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":250,"cn_text":"“我在越南见识过地狱……什么事我都干给你看。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":251,"cn_text":"“从越南回来以后，故乡已经没有我的容身之处……能让我留在这里吗？”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":252,"cn_text":"“我祖父以前是机械师。风冷发动机的话，我5分钟就能拆开！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":85,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":253,"cn_text":"“格斗桑博、武术，空手道我还是五段！\nCQC？我有兴趣。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":79,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":254,"cn_text":"“给我任务吧，Boss！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":31,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":255,"cn_text":"“我是兵器技师。\n兵器是杀人的工具？不，是保护人的工具。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":85,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":256,"cn_text":"“我以前是水手，对自己的视力很有信心！\n能让我发挥这项本领吗？”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":94,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":257,"cn_text":"“我女儿明年就12岁了。我一定得活下去！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":59,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":258,"cn_text":"“我的朋友死在了上一个战场……\n能让我在这里……替他报仇吗？”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":91,"review_flag":"JPN_FRIEND_DIED_AND_REVENGE_SEMANTICS_PRESERVED; AUX_MAKE_IT_UP_PARAPHRASE_REJECTED"},{"unique_index":259,"cn_text":"“让我……助你一臂之力吧。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":260,"cn_text":"“精神抖擞！力量涌现！！激情迸发！！！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":"JPN_THREE_PART_EXCITED_EXCLAMATION_PRESERVED; AUX_COMPRESSED_PARAPHRASE_REJECTED"},{"unique_index":261,"cn_text":"“不管什么命令我都能完成。现在的我一定可以！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":262,"cn_text":"“我的爱好是园艺。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":263,"cn_text":"“Miller摘下太阳镜以后，眼睛意外地还挺可爱的呢。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":264,"cn_text":"“‘潜友’这称呼听起来真不错……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":265,"cn_text":"“Boss！请把我派到战场上！我一定会活着回来！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":67,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":266,"cn_text":"“Boss！请把我派到战场上！\n我已经坐不住了！身体都在发痒！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":86,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":267,"cn_text":"“交给我的任务，我会全力完成！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":268,"cn_text":"“啊……Boss……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":25,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":269,"cn_text":"“别因为我是女人就小看我。女人有女人的战斗方式！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":270,"cn_text":"“听说你不擅长应付吸血鬼，是真的吗？\nBoss也有可爱的一面……呢！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":95,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":271,"cn_text":"“我可是会乱来的哦～？”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":"JPN_RECKLESS_NUANCE_PRESERVED; AUX_CRAZY_PARAPHRASE_REJECTED"},{"unique_index":272,"cn_text":"“我可能不太懂变通。不过我有信心活下来。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":273,"cn_text":"“难受的时候就想想我。也许能稍微减轻一点痛苦。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":274,"cn_text":"“你的目光在望着哪里……？失礼了，我问得太深入了。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":"JPN_WHERE_ARE_YOUR_EYES_LOOKING_AND_PRYING_NUANCE_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":275,"cn_text":"“你相信占卜吗？我只相信你。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":276,"cn_text":"“我很喜欢这里。是个好地方。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":277,"cn_text":"“身体都燃起来了。来，给我任务吧。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":278,"cn_text":"“服从不是我的爱好。不过只有Boss是特别的。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":64,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":279,"cn_text":"“我原本最讨厌和别人扎堆。不过价值观还真是轻易就会改变。\n来到这里以后，我深有体会。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":127,"review_flag":"JPN_AVERSION_TO_GROUPING_AND_CHANGED_VALUES_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":280,"cn_text":"“我讨厌为了别人去做什么。不过现在，我愿意为了Boss去做。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":85,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":281,"cn_text":"“请下命令吧，Boss。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":31,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":282,"cn_text":"“光盯着我看，我可不会行动。来吧，让我听听你的想法。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":283,"cn_text":"“我自己也不知道擅长什么……\nBoss，你能看出我的技能吗？”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":83,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":284,"cn_text":"“请不要被性别束缚地调配人员。我相信Boss。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":64,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":285,"cn_text":"“你相信命运吗？现在的我，愿意相信。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":286,"cn_text":"“凡事都是经验！这么想的话，训练也……呜，好累。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":287,"cn_text":"“从背后靠近敌人，用电击棒电得噼里啪啦！连我这边都觉得麻了！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":"JPN_STUN_ROD_SHARED_NUMBNESS_WORDPLAY_PRESERVED; AUX_EXCITEMENT_EXPANSION_REJECTED"},{"unique_index":288,"cn_text":"“我喜欢后坐力小的‘M16A1’。\nBoss喜欢什么枪？”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":67,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":289,"cn_text":"“不偷懒、不着急，先‘简报’！……Boss，你是这么说的吧？”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":85,"review_flag":"JPN_DONT_SLACK_DONT_RUSH_BRIEFING_WORDING_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":290,"cn_text":"“对伙伴说的一句话，有时也能改变局面……\n不愧是Boss！看问题的地方就是不一样！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":116,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":291,"cn_text":"“武器真是越用越顺手啊。\n简直就像身体的一部分……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":76,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":292,"cn_text":"“恢复LIFE最好的办法就是睡觉！\n睡不了的时候就趴着别动！YES, SIR！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":94,"review_flag":"JPN_LIFE_RECOVERY_PRONE_STILLNESS_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":293,"cn_text":"“‘3槽位型’的武器切换虽然有点特别，但习惯以后很方便。\n相当厉害哦。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":104,"review_flag":"THREE_SLOT_TYPE_TERMINOLOGY_REVIEW"},{"unique_index":294,"cn_text":"“来不及瞄准的时候就切换到‘AUTO AIM’。\n我就是靠这个活到现在的。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":295,"cn_text":"“用电击棒打晕、用麻醉枪催眠、从背后用枪顶住进行Hold Up……\n就算都叫‘无力化’，方法也有很多啊，Boss！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":150,"review_flag":"JPN_NEUTRALIZE_TERM_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":296,"cn_text":"“想拿到最高通关评价，就要‘不杀人’、‘不被发现’、‘迅速完成’！\n我很期待哦，Boss！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":128,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":297,"cn_text":"“我不喜欢头发受损，不过我会战斗的。只要是为了你。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":298,"cn_text":"“‘一种武器用得越久，就越能发挥出它原本的力量’吗……\n原来如此，学到了！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":112,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":299,"cn_text":"“没有口粮的话，吃点零食不就好了。\n‘咖喱’也很难舍弃呢！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":88,"review_flag":"JPN_RATION_SWEETS_CURRY_WORDING_PRESERVED; AUX_SNACK_PARAPHRASE_REJECTED"}]}